  "description": "Rope-Kun Adventure is a top-down puzzle-action game.\nUnleash the full potential of the rope and work with Rope-kun to overcome various challenges!\n\n＊Features＊\n・Unique gameplay system of \"\"rope action\"\"!\n・Simple, intuitive controls that anyone can pick up!\n・Tons of brain-teasing puzzle gimmicks!\n・Fun battles with wacky enemy characters!\n\n＊Rope Handling＊\nThe possibilities of ropes are endless!\nHere are just a few:\n\n1. Pull\nConnect Rope-kun to objects and drag them around!\n\n2. Bounce\nUse the rope to bounce off rolling balls!\n\n3. Bind\nTie up enemies with the rope to defeat them!",
